                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <header class=consumer-finance>
                                            <h2>
                                                <a href=/consumer-finance/the-impact-of-covid-19-relief-programs-getting-granular-to-see-the-big-picture>
                                                    The Impact of COVID-19 Relief Programs: Getting Granular to See the Big Picture
                                                </a>
                                            </h2>
                                                    <div class="article-authors-date">
                                                        <p class="article-author-by">by</p>
                                                        <ul class="authors">
<li class="author"><a href="/our-people/patrick-t-harker" itemprop="author">Patrick T. Harker</a></li>                                                        </ul>
                                                        <p class="article-date">05 Jan ’22</p>
                                                    </div>
                                        </header>
                                        <p class="article-excerpt">A wealth of data flows through Philadelphia Fed, painting a picture of the economy in our region and the nation. But who are the people behind those data points, and how are their daily realities touched by government policies? President Harker explores this idea with a focus on COVID-19 relief programs.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                </div>
            </div>
